@startuml animal_list
title GET /animals — List all Animals

actor Client
participant "AnimalController" as Controller
participant "ListAnimalsUseCase\n<<port.in>>" as UseCase
participant "ListAnimalsService" as Service
participant "AnimalRepository\n<<port.out>>" as Repo
participant "AnimalJpaMapper" as Mapper
participant "AnimalJpaRepository\n<<spring-data>>" as JpaRepo
database "MySQL" as DB

note over Client, DB
  AuthFilter ya validó el JWT y puso EmployeeContext
  en SecurityContextHolder antes de llegar al controller.
end note

note over Client, DB
  Hibernate `@SoftDelete` filtra automáticamente:
  - DELETE → UPDATE enabled=false
  - Todo SELECT añade WHERE enabled=true
end note

Client -> Controller : GET /animals
activate Controller

Controller -> UseCase : listAll()
UseCase -> Service : listAll()
activate Service

Service -> Repo : findAll()
activate Repo
Repo -> JpaRepo : findAll()
JpaRepo -> DB : SELECT animal\nJOIN FETCH (specie, breed, owner, company, color)\nvia @EntityGraph
DB --> JpaRepo : rows[]
JpaRepo --> Repo : List<AnimalJpaEntity>
Repo -> Mapper : toDomain(entity) por cada row
Mapper --> Repo : List<Animal>
Repo --> Service : List<Animal>
deactivate Repo

Service -> Service : stream().map(AnimalDto::from).toList()
Service --> UseCase : List<AnimalDto>
UseCase --> Controller : List<AnimalDto>
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : stream().map(toResponse).toList()
Controller --> Client : 200 OK\nList<AnimalResponse>
deactivate Controller

@enduml
